# UTF-8 BOM before the first header (case 06).
-- input.cnf.esc --
\ufeff[mydumper]\nthreads=4\n
-- fixed.cnf --
[mydumper]
threads=4
-- diagnostics --
1:1-1:2 error MDL101[utf8-bom] file starts with a UTF-8 byte order mark (BOM)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
  fix (safe): Remove the byte order mark
